10&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lbgjGg3YQV4Q7kNvwHxS4yQ&_nc_oc=AdoyuSB-fvPcCFjmOlaRvsRaga-3ctz5axln2nXp6f4sUIA04wv1srsDGy_lAvT4C8k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKGnPdvUp5ht_2f4aK4yNyvYGsxiJG1sS73HzmmO_gwKQ&oe=6A9AD4BD"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "2230572054152344", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622285_2230572057485677_2372904277471757210_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1aNcGyUlWTAQ7kNvwENeWgw&_nc_oc=AdrMYv4M3KmVtMG2do_BH3dRJft_r3g_PrKwAKkN57m5R2wyze0ukceJQxnRgUpyZnQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJg3RSrVmpN6g5otHRWw-NahSxcHEd0x2Swn4TlxS19HA&oe=6A9AE0CA"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1371269948213119", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619808_1371269951546452_7889463761728838125_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HuxpkwAF4MIQ7kNvwGZ7TOK&_nc_oc=AdrVzamLExqpWQJ02aHngaaWWflEiUP2ivJqUP9elWpYiTuxHZ4FzKCuuQ8yCfstjGs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKg7G9qbceQFinf-U-NEUxUa5Zl1ybYY5-PS6w92xws8Q&oe=6A9AD585"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1017884687540315", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620965_1017884690873648_2203116526645987407_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_Kzf9iBdKzIQ7kNvwFeazMv&_nc_oc=Adq7TeWX0b4y7-VjldQHERV0fYU22_k9TDX_q9zTEWsTmWBYJg6xf5kbziK-nFWfsgM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLaERbvY76x-vzjAn9Ct6FByLB73mj1ThrsTPqT9CM72A&oe=6A9ACF56"}, "display_name": "Fit Squat XR: Lower Body Workout", "keywords": ["Fitness", "Rhythm", "Cardio", "Exercise", "Training"], "long_description": "# Turn Squats into an Energizing Rhythm Game! \u26a1    \u3000\n\nBored of standard workouts? **Fit Squat XR** transforms a powerful lower-body workout into an exhilarating rhythm challenge. Sync your movement to the music, dodge obstacles, and build strength while enjoying the game.    \n\n# \ud83d\udd25 Key Features\n\n* **\ud83c\udfb5 Rhythm-Driven Workout**\n\n Move to the beat! Walls rush toward you in time with the music, turning intense leg exercise into pure gameplay.  \n* **\ud83d\udcaa Scale Your Challenge**\n\nFind your perfect pace with **EASY**, **NORMAL**, or **HARD** modes. Crank it up to HARD for rapid squat sequences that will truly test your legs and glutes.    \n* **\ud83d\udcc8 Calorie Tracking**\n\nKeep track of your energy burned after every session. Your progress is personal, rewarding, and visible.   \n* **\ud83d\ude4c Controller-Free Freedom**\n\nExperience the ultimate comfort with Hand Tracking. Ditch the controllers and move naturally with your hands completely free. \n* **\ud83c\udfe0 Turn Your Room into a Gym (MR Mode)**\n\nWith Mixed Reality, rhythmic neon walls stream directly into your living space! Stay aware of your real-world surroundings while you move. \n\n\n\n> **Ready to move? Squat to the beat and crush your fitness goals today! \ud83c\udfc6**", "short_description": "Drop low, feel the beat, and break a sweat! \ud83c\udfcb\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Fit Squat XR is your immersive VR rhythm fitness arena where your lower body takes center stage. Dodge incoming walls in time with high-energy tracks. Challenge your legs with multiple difficulty levels and feel the rhythm. Your next leg workout starts now! \ud83c\udfc6  \n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/privacypolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "New Story Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/product/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": n